FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H002FıAAF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,120,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Th...Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This can't be happening!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:02:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,CP9's leader, Mr. Rob Lucci, is considered to be the most powerful agent...Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,in the history of Cipher Pol.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,240,,Utter DefeatDialogue: 1,0:02:04.22,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,240,,Utter DefeatDialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,His defeat at the hands of a mere pirate is unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy won!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,He had me on pins and needles there.Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So you finally did it, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry to the ship! We're gonna set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You morons! The Navy will hear us!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay! Let them hear!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who's saying that?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:16.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Unknown! They're transmitting via transponder snail!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What is this voice?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:44.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut yer mouth! If only we'd taken off, the Navy would've thought we died!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Those guys!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the likelihood they're the same pirates we eliminated at the main gate?Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see how. I'm sure they all fell off the cliff!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.85,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could've survived.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, idiot! Don't push!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't move!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The ropes are gonna rip!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You morons! Galley-La's ropes never break!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, I already toldya to keep yer mouth shut.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all okay!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:10.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The giants blocked us from the cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:14.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They're undeniably tenacious.Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma! They're all alive!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah are gonna make it too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to hear that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:26.93,Main,,0,0,0,,But if we stick around here, the battleships are sure to come back.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get the hell outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:33.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, and we have a means of escape, so don't worry about us!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:34.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's meet up after we get out alive!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:37.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys gonna climb, or what?Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:43.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The blood is rushing up to my head!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:45.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's rushing down!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, climb up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Climb up slowly!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't shake!Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You stupid... jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:06:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys think I was worried? You dumbasses!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Those numbskulls are alive! I... I couldn't be happier! What a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No denying it's a relief,Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,but it'd be a waste if you died here, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we head over to the main gate right away?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Later. For now, we should focus our efforts here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you all doing?! Carry out your orders already!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bring on as many guys as you've got!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Tiger Trap!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Oni Giri!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Pound Phoenix!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Cien Fleur!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on Straw Hat in the first column!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir, but...Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:14.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:19.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat Luffy appears to be severely wounded!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,He isn't moving at all!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?! Hurry and get your butt over here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We're as good as dead if we stay here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?! We're so close!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Use your Rubber Rubber and shoot yourself over here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you the rest of the way!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded by the sea and a bunch of battleships!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:06.09,Main,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're goners!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:09.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that the pirates are trying to escape aboard the escort ship.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I can't.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,My body.Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't move at all.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't move?Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! You defeated the enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin's back too! All we need to do now is leave!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Give it your all!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:04.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take the ship over to Luffy's column.Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Hurry aboard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Our escape ship!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Now it's hopeless.Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:32.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That ship was our only way outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:43.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san... Chimney... Gonbe... Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh no.Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,They survived somehow!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta the way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun! Where in the world have you been?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. I had to take care of something.Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we're in serious trouble here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Since getting back Robin-chan,Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought this area would be safe from attack. But the ship–Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.83,Main,,0,0,0,,This is as far as you go! Release the old lady now and–Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't waste our time!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Now they're firing on their own people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut them off at the second column!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Run! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:21.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Looks like they demolished the entire bridge.Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.81,Main,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on this column!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We're out of options!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No choice but to fight them all here and now!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?! Each new wave of enemies is gonna be stronger than the last!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready all cannons to fire on the first column!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Eliminate Straw Hat Luffy immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:55.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy's in danger! We need to at least get him over here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:03.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't work. At this distance,Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,even if I try to pull him, I'll drop him into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:12.61,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad. They're in a real pickle!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat won, but he can't stand up! It seems like his life is in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:20.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand up, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:27.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, kid!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate guy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Stand up! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.99,0:13:35.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something you can do, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:36.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! You can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. I'm in serious trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:55.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Again?Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:56.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you tryna get killed?! This is no time to be spacing out!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Just whose voice is this?Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's right! It's the same voice from before.Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:22.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's obvious! It's my minions!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Not those voices! I've been hearing it for a while!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:30.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:44.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Below?Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Look below?Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do hear it. What? Below?Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:10.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:20.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's telling us to look below!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about, reindeer-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready the guns to fire at Straw Hat Luffy in the first column in five seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:30.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Jump into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Four seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, can you drop Luffy into the sea?Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:52.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Are you trying to get us to kill ourselves?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:57.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Something so drastic won't save us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Three!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be saved! She came to rescue us!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:06.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got one more friend, remember?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Two!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Did you look below?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I did!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Cien Fleur:Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,One!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:27.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Delphinium!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm moving! Is Robin doing this?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.90,0:16:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates are jumping into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,How stupid! There's no surviving these waters.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they out of their minds?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:22.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's go back!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:32.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:43.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Back to the seas of adventure!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:51.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Jump on the Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:00.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I came to get you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What're they trying to pull?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Jumping into the sea is the last thing they should do!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,A few of them are also ability users!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,That's suicide!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:13.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a sec.Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a ship! Judging by the Jolly Roger, it's the Straw Hat Pirates' ship!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How did it sneak past all our battleships undetected?Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but thanks...Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Sanji-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, Nami-san,Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,while the rope ladder definitely lowered, there doesn't look to be anyone here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:22.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously. Learn how to swim, brother!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, get on board, all of you with powers!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-chwan!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Come fly into my arms!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Merry! It's the Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I really love the Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Merry. Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,My Merry is alive!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Why are you so...Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:03.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I-If I could... If only I could do more!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:08.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! This ship plummeted into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Who could have sailed the ship here?Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:27.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll talk about it later! Give us your instructions!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing, Sanji-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:34.23,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nami-swan!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.01,0:20:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close! I thought those battleships were gonna kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:43.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! You saved me! Thank y–Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Just leave the rest to us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... and everyone,Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.58,Main,,0,0,0,,thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You can say stupid stuff like that once we escape.Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "stupid stuff," you damn Moss Head?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you damn Moss Head?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! If we die here, none of this'll mean a damn thing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Robin-chan, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:43.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right! Apologize to Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.73,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.73,0:21:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hey, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You can move now?Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:51.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right! I'm moving!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can move now, Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Robin already!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:58.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Give up yet?Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:22:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,No! No!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,C'mon, guys! Let's hurry and get outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:10.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! This is unacceptable! Are you guys just letting them get away?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,If they're going to escape, might as well blow up Nico Robin after all!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,But we have to capture her alive!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,This is coming straight from Admiral Aokiji.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:22.57,Main,,0,0,0,,All ships! Prepare to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,F-From A-Admiral Aokiji?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Aim at them!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.27,0:22:32.27,Main,,0,0,0,,All ships! Ready the guns to fire! All ships! Ready the guns to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.23,0:22:37.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They fell for it. I can't let them get away. They need to die.Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:39.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll just kill 'em all!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get the lead out and load the cannonballs!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,So Spandam is alive.Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna fire at us!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:51.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch the wind from starboard and head east!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:53.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't! We're completely surrounded!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,There're just too many cannons!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:59.64,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll hit the ship for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:00.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Here it comes!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, did those misfire? None of their other attacks are hitting us either!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.19,0:23:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Just where do you think you're all aiming?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.66,0:23:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong! It's like the cannons are aiming themselves!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give me a half-baked excuse!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.09,0:23:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay clear!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't! We're gonna collide!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way! What the hell is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.69,0:23:44.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! Give me a report!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Look over there!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice suddenly began to close.Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Currents normally blocked by the gates are producing whirlpools,Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,and we've lost control of the rudder!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,So that explains our imprecise aim!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get swept up by the currents!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is going on?Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:09.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out that fire! On the double!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.60,0:24:11.72,Main,,0,0,0,,This is too much! Everyone, get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiots! Why did you close the gates? What did you morons think would happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The lever for the gates is in the third column of the Bridge of Hesitation,Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,so we couldn't have touched it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:23.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is better than I expected!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:26.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Don't tell me you did something earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.43,0:24:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Guts alone won't let us escape this kind of foe. Right?Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.81,0:24:38.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bingo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's amazing, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of genius?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate to cut the celebrations short, but the whirlpools are a problem for us too.Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! That's right! We're–Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.46,0:24:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.53,0:24:59.14,Main,,0,0,0,,There wasn't a sea the Merry couldn't cross with us on board!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:25:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.99,0:25:03.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We're counting on you, navigator!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.99,0:25:03.10,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! You're so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.58,0:25:05.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Just hold them off until I figure out the trajectory of the whirlpools!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.79,0:25:06.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style: 36-Pound Phoenix!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.23,0:25:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Why?! Why can't you bring down one puny little ship with seven battleships?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.04,0:25:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You useless morons!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're coming your way, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.57,0:25:34.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Leave them to me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I missed one! Sanji, take care of it!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Basse Côte!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I'm gonna fight too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.49,0:25:44.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You can't move, can you?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:48.98,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right, Luffy. Leave this one to us...Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:51.19,Main,,0,0,0,,and take it easy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.61,0:26:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I don't care what you guys say;Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.54,0:26:05.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.12,0:26:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give a medal to the one who actually hits them! So hurry up and hit them!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.02,0:26:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,All ships! Concentrate cannons on their ship's aft deck.Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:14.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.97,0:26:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't talk back! I'm your captain!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.80,0:26:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.53,0:26:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,One...Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:36.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Two...Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.99,0:26:38.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Three!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.91,0:26:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Not good! They're bouncing back our way!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.33,0:26:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That saved us, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Just what we'd expect from you, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you guys demons?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.37,0:26:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Victory!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.55,0:27:02.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I see it... the way to victory!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.51,0:27:05.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper, hard aport at 9 o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.61,0:27:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate ship escaped toward the falls!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all idiots?! Sink that ship already!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.83,0:27:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems they're using  the natural flow of the whirlpools!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Their speed is ludicrous!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.41,0:27:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be useful too!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Go for it, reindeer-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.25,0:27:32.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Full speed ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.31,0:27:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Dammit! Those bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.66,0:27:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,With the entire military force of Enies Lobby at our disposal...Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.30,0:27:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,With the power of the buster call, as strong as an entire country's military...Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.76,0:27:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Why... Why in the hell can't we...Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.73,0:27:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Why? Why can't we take a single woman...Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.23,0:28:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,from a puny little band of pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.35,0:28:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.29,0:28:40.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Help.Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.17,0:28:44.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Clutch!Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.27,0:28:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.79,0:29:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, pirates! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:29:00.39,Secondary,,0,0,0,,All right, it's about time.Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.39,0:29:01.63,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Franky,Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.01,0:29:03.59,Main,,0,0,0,,could you do that thing?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, brace yourselves.Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.52,0:29:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Block their route! The enemy ship can't get out of the whirlpools!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,This'll be rough on the ship. Sorry about that.Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.59,0:29:24.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Coup de Vent!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The pirate ship is flying!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.91,0:29:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,They've gone outside the fleet's range!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.35,0:29:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate what she's been through!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:40.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Merry flew 10,000 meters high in the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.60,0:29:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Lethal Super Smoke Star!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.95,0:29:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a smokescreen!Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.45,0:29:56.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.72,0:29:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,After them! We bow to nobody in speed!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.97,0:30:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't! We're caught in the whirlpools!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.60,0:30:03.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's taking everything we've got just to stay afloat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.39,0:30:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.13,0:30:45.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that Straw Hat and the others were able to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.86,0:30:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! We'll head back too!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.75,0:31:04.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Puffing Tom!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.67,0:31:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll still pursue them.Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.61,0:31:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly let it end like this.Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.13,0:31:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,To maintain our dignity as the Navy— no, as the World Government—Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.66,0:31:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll bring down the Straw Hat Pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.23,0:31:30.03,Main,,0,0,0,,and we'll capture Nico Robin, the most dangerous criminal, without fail!Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.03,0:31:34.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we require fleet reinforcements and additional marines–Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.35,0:31:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.33,0:31:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But–Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We used a buster call, an attack as strong as entire nations.Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.60,0:31:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,When you look at the blunder this fleet made and the current state...Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.80,0:31:47.30,Main,,0,0,0,,of Enies Lobby, the very symbol of law, it's quite apparent.Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.49,0:31:52.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This battle ends in our utter defeat.Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.53,0:31:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the top of this ram's head here okay?Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.15,0:31:58.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep. That's my seat.Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.93,0:32:02.55,Main,,0,0,0,,There you go. Be careful not to fall.Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.21,0:32:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks, old monster lady.Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.57,0:32:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Merry.Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.31,0:32:12.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we were able to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.15,0:32:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I never would've imagined that you'd come, Merry.Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.45,0:32:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,But when I think about it, you've always protected us.Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.24,0:32:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that you're our friend.Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Merry!Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.89,0:32:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate,Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.33,0:32:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,you guys sure did pull one outrageous stunt back there.Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.26,0:32:37.19,Main,,0,0,0,,To start with, who would've guessed that you'd shoot the World Government's flag!Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.19,0:32:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not a big deal.Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.51,0:32:46.65,Main,,0,0,0,,All we did was take back a friend who was taken from us.Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us save Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.53,0:32:56.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, y'know, it was no big deal.Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway,Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.16,0:33:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,we claim...Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,this fight...Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.33,0:33:06.25,Main,,0,0,0,,as a win!Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:09.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.22,0:33:17.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: KaitouYahiko  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack Zenef  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:0